# Record with: vhs docs/demo.tape  (run inside kitty with remote control enabled)
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "teampane doctor"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "teampane run claude"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "Spawn three teammates: a researcher, an implementer and a reviewer, to review this repo"
Enter
Sleep 30s
